WEBVTT

00:00:13.310 --> 00:00:17.590
I know this cold voice

00:00:17.590 --> 00:00:22.020
Taking my friend

00:00:22.020 --> 00:00:26.800
Maybe a little afraid you'll run away

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:29.700
But right now...

00:00:30.690 --> 00:00:34.720
For this moment in time, I want to hold you tight

00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:39.580
By your side, I'm dreaming of the days

00:00:39.580 --> 00:00:44.060
When I finally look up at the promised sky

00:00:44.330 --> 00:00:48.470
I'll take off and break all the way

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:53.420
For this moment in time, I just wanna be with you

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:57.940
By your side, I'm dreaming of the days

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:02.250
When I finally look up at the promised sky

00:01:02.770 --> 00:01:06.750
I know I can change all the way

00:01:07.270 --> 00:01:11.830
For the moment...

00:01:11.830 --> 00:01:21.320
I just wanna hold you...

00:01:43.190 --> 00:01:44.880
Your hair's gotten so long...

00:01:45.280 --> 00:01:46.310
Want to cut it?

00:01:46.330 --> 00:01:47.770
You wouldn't mind?

00:01:47.970 --> 00:01:49.360
Not if it's what you want.

00:01:49.530 --> 00:01:51.470
Please, stop!

00:01:51.530 --> 00:01:54.980
What, Toranosuke? Why are you screaming bloody murder?

00:01:55.500 --> 00:02:00.250
Miss Kajika, do you have any idea what you're saying?

00:02:00.880 --> 00:02:03.700
Someone with your congenital incompetence...

00:02:04.030 --> 00:02:06.740
cutting this beautiful, silken hair?!

00:02:07.440 --> 00:02:10.470
Don't you remember what happened with the soup?

00:02:11.050 --> 00:02:14.920
The soup? Mustafa enjoyed it, didn't he?

00:02:15.570 --> 00:02:18.090
He compared it to three-star French cuisine.

00:02:19.170 --> 00:02:22.890
You can't just alter your memories as you see fit. Anyway, you can't do this!

00:02:23.390 --> 00:02:28.840
Why do you get so worked up about things when it comes to Mustafa, Toranosuke?

00:02:29.870 --> 00:02:31.440
I don't know what you're...

00:02:31.470 --> 00:02:33.390
Maybe someone has a little crush...

00:02:33.510 --> 00:02:35.120
That's not true!

00:02:35.200 --> 00:02:37.510
You should just come out and say it like a man!

00:02:37.980 --> 00:02:39.490
Right, Mustafa?

00:02:39.570 --> 00:02:41.390
Please, stop!

00:02:42.550 --> 00:02:44.430
I think I'll send for a barber...

00:02:47.050 --> 00:02:48.500
An uprising?

00:02:48.540 --> 00:02:51.160
Yes, some time ago Master Lee-Leng mentioned it...

00:02:51.720 --> 00:02:57.100
Although the government of Raginei is not acknowledging the existence of the uprising here in the north...

00:02:57.580 --> 00:03:01.010
there are reports that a faction of the army participated in it.

00:03:03.080 --> 00:03:05.360
--Brother...
--A year after King Somand's accession...

00:03:05.660 --> 00:03:08.620
the political situation has undeniably remained unstable.

00:03:10.050 --> 00:03:13.710
This is Janet Smith, reporting from Raginei.

00:03:15.170 --> 00:03:20.200
"Breaking Away"

00:03:33.470 --> 00:03:37.410
Well, please give my regards to His Majesty the King.

00:03:40.830 --> 00:03:43.930
Much obliged, as always, for your kind wishes.

00:03:49.740 --> 00:03:52.000
Things have really changed in the last year.

00:03:52.500 --> 00:03:56.330
This is all it takes to get a contract for an oil pipeline now...

00:04:00.700 --> 00:04:02.770
Sareha!

00:04:02.840 --> 00:04:04.060
Master Kanan...

00:04:04.150 --> 00:04:06.610
Those men were from Courage Oil, weren't they.

00:04:06.730 --> 00:04:08.430
Ah--yes.

00:04:08.750 --> 00:04:12.230
Improving the decor in your room again, I see.

00:04:12.820 --> 00:04:14.990
It's like the fable of the ass in the lion's skin...

00:04:15.300 --> 00:04:16.690
I resent that...

00:04:17.170 --> 00:04:19.340
I'm not like you.

00:04:21.200 --> 00:04:24.000
Is that how you speak to the Grand Chamberlain?!

00:04:24.210 --> 00:04:25.980
What's going on here?

00:04:26.370 --> 00:04:27.960
Master Quinza...

00:04:29.160 --> 00:04:32.390
Quarreling in the Royal Palace is hardly appropriate.

00:04:32.890 --> 00:04:34.550
I apologize.

00:04:39.870 --> 00:04:41.210
Master Quinza...

00:04:41.320 --> 00:04:44.040
What became of the northern uprising?

00:04:44.400 --> 00:04:48.200
Commander Namka of the Imperial Guard is investigating it now.

00:04:48.860 --> 00:04:50.470
Ah, here he is.

00:04:53.660 --> 00:04:56.050
Forgive me for interrupting you and Master Quinza.

00:04:56.420 --> 00:05:00.700
We were just discussing the recent uprising.

00:05:01.210 --> 00:05:03.350
Yes, sir. I've just finished investigating...

00:05:03.450 --> 00:05:06.550
and it wasn't a full-scale uprising...

00:05:06.740 --> 00:05:10.000
but some disruptive elements may have been involved.

00:05:10.610 --> 00:05:12.870
We're planning on making sweeping arrests.

00:05:13.440 --> 00:05:17.770
Is that right? Thank you very much for all your efforts.

00:05:18.480 --> 00:05:23.410
Not at all. With the cooperation of the Special Police led by Master Sareha...

00:05:23.720 --> 00:05:26.000
the burden has actually decreased.

00:05:29.940 --> 00:05:34.290
At any rate, His Majesty prays above all for the safety of his people.

00:05:34.780 --> 00:05:39.450
If that can be achieved, it may be worth the position of Grand Chamberlain...

00:05:39.550 --> 00:05:41.060
Y--yes, sir!

00:05:44.600 --> 00:05:48.630
<i>To satisfy his immediate hunger, he'll keep dancing attendance...</i>

00:05:49.150 --> 00:05:52.400
<i>What else can a performing monkey do?</i>

00:05:56.710 --> 00:06:01.700
<i>In the end, a dictatorship maintained by force cannot last long.</i>

00:06:05.100 --> 00:06:09.130
<i>What's more, I am writing the story of its collapse.</i>

00:06:11.610 --> 00:06:14.190
<i>Until the right moment comes...</i>

00:06:14.730 --> 00:06:17.140
<i>it's enough to keep dreaming.</i>

00:06:21.420 --> 00:06:23.370
<i>Beautiful...</i>

00:06:24.240 --> 00:06:26.620
<i>The Temple of the Rock, with a thousand years of history behind it.</i>

00:06:28.270 --> 00:06:30.790
<i>Truly, the Lord Ragi is in this place.</i>

00:06:37.510 --> 00:06:41.640
<i>It's this powerful Temple of the Rock that is the very soul of our Raginei.</i>

00:06:50.440 --> 00:06:51.760
Is that you, Ioe?

00:06:52.710 --> 00:06:54.140
I'm sorry to keep you waiting.

00:06:54.810 --> 00:06:56.400
Does this place still frighten you?

00:06:56.770 --> 00:06:58.090
I just can't get used to it.

00:06:58.410 --> 00:07:01.790
I was taught growing up that, outside of the King...

00:07:01.950 --> 00:07:05.740
only an elite few--the priests, the Grand Chamberlain, Guests of State--were permitted to enter here.

00:07:06.590 --> 00:07:07.930
It's overwhelming...

00:07:07.950 --> 00:07:12.050
I was told the same thing; it's all for the sake of the King.

00:07:12.670 --> 00:07:16.580
Well, and have you discovered who is leading the rebels?

00:07:17.170 --> 00:07:20.430
Yes. It's an army officer, Captain Sabaji.

00:07:20.700 --> 00:07:22.140
What's his connection to Noei?

00:07:22.160 --> 00:07:24.200
There's no evidence of a connection.

00:07:24.510 --> 00:07:28.610
There has been no news of 2nd Lt. Noei in a year.

00:07:29.060 --> 00:07:30.970
Some say he's dead...

00:07:31.150 --> 00:07:32.700
He is not.

00:07:33.300 --> 00:07:36.650
He's single-minded, but he's not stupid.

00:07:37.230 --> 00:07:39.710
He must be in hiding, waiting for his chance.

00:07:40.820 --> 00:07:42.390
Master Quinza...

00:07:42.520 --> 00:07:45.560
<i>His goal is most likely the voluntary abdication of King Somand.</i>

00:07:46.280 --> 00:07:49.080
<i>But taking half-measures like that...</i>

00:07:49.300 --> 00:07:52.470
<i>cannot possibly drain all the rot and infection out of the Royal Palace.</i>

00:07:53.260 --> 00:07:55.480
<i>It seems we are bound to conflict.</i>

00:07:55.580 --> 00:07:56.980
Um, also...

00:07:57.470 --> 00:07:58.650
What?

00:07:58.710 --> 00:08:00.880
This is only a rumor, but...

00:08:01.170 --> 00:08:04.000
some people are saying the House of Chadli has something do with it.

00:08:04.600 --> 00:08:06.150
Chadli...

00:08:06.770 --> 00:08:08.380
Najayra?

00:08:36.370 --> 00:08:39.140
These are pictures of the uprising going on in the north.

00:08:39.650 --> 00:08:41.910
They were taken by members of the foreign media.

00:08:42.450 --> 00:08:46.860
Captain Sabaji? He's never shown this kind of radical behavior.

00:08:47.110 --> 00:08:49.890
What now? Do we offer support?

00:08:50.460 --> 00:08:52.940
No--Captain Sabaji's goal...

00:08:53.230 --> 00:08:56.250
is to abolish the monarchy and establish a republic.

00:08:56.900 --> 00:08:58.520
Even if it worked temporarily...

00:08:58.830 --> 00:09:01.570
I doubt an unstable administration based on military authority...

00:09:01.870 --> 00:09:04.430
could rebuild Raginei.

00:09:05.120 --> 00:09:09.500
Especially when the country lasted a thousand years based on the royal family...

00:09:09.900 --> 00:09:12.700
What we need to rebuild is a powerful symbol...

00:09:13.080 --> 00:09:15.470
and, there is no option there except His Highness Rumaty.

00:09:15.900 --> 00:09:17.340
You're absolutely right, but...

00:09:17.670 --> 00:09:19.090
Even though he would be facing danger...

00:09:19.460 --> 00:09:23.030
we have no choice but for him to leave America and come to a neighboring country.

00:09:23.670 --> 00:09:26.540
If he does, the will of the people will shift towards him...

00:09:27.270 --> 00:09:31.300
and King Somand will begin exploring voluntary abdication.

00:09:32.170 --> 00:09:34.740
But how can we get to His Highness Rumaty?

00:09:42.400 --> 00:09:44.680
I will go see him.

00:09:45.090 --> 00:09:47.340
Lieutenant, it's too dangerous!

00:09:48.550 --> 00:09:52.020
I'm the only one of us who can get close to His Highness.

00:09:52.510 --> 00:09:54.880
Goslen, I'm leaving you in charge.

00:09:55.260 --> 00:09:56.680
Lieutenant Noei...

00:09:58.160 --> 00:10:00.640
The Special Police!

00:10:17.350 --> 00:10:19.910
<i>In any event, we have to hurry.</i>

00:10:20.230 --> 00:10:23.590
<i>Unless something changes, there is going to be bloodshed.</i>

00:10:25.680 --> 00:10:27.810
<i>If he were to abdicate voluntarily...</i>

00:10:28.700 --> 00:10:31.380
<i>confinement or exile would be waiting for him.</i>

00:10:31.990 --> 00:10:34.630
<i>Whichever he chose, his life would be saved.</i>

00:10:35.530 --> 00:10:37.790
<i>Your Majesty...</i>

00:10:40.220 --> 00:10:43.820
<i>This is the only way I have left to prove my loyalty.</i>

00:10:59.790 --> 00:11:02.750
Huh? When did you come to America, Eddie?

00:11:03.250 --> 00:11:05.640
This morning. From Raginei.

00:11:06.260 --> 00:11:08.730
Phew... flying coach really sucks.

00:11:08.850 --> 00:11:10.400
Well, first of all, would you like some tea?

00:11:10.790 --> 00:11:15.070
Yeah! You sure got a lot more womanly in just a year.

00:11:15.580 --> 00:11:17.990
Just missing a teensy bit of sex appeal.

00:11:18.140 --> 00:11:20.670
Sex appeal? What does that mean?

00:11:21.110 --> 00:11:23.330
Get yourself a boyfriend and you'll figure it out naturally.

00:11:24.160 --> 00:11:26.230
Keep your crap to yourself.

00:11:26.330 --> 00:11:30.290
That hurt, friend o' mine, especially when this is our long-awaited reunion.

00:11:30.530 --> 00:11:32.660
I saw you a month ago in Paris.

00:11:35.080 --> 00:11:37.700
Well? Where might young Mister Raginei be?

00:11:37.980 --> 00:11:40.220
Are you going to request an interview with Rumaty again?

00:11:41.060 --> 00:11:42.400
Uh-huh.

00:11:43.310 --> 00:11:44.940
About the uprising?

00:11:45.900 --> 00:11:47.080
Lee-Leng!

00:11:47.110 --> 00:11:49.960
Young Master Huang is just as well-informed as you'd expect.

00:11:50.410 --> 00:11:54.930
I've heard that a military contingent rebelled.

00:11:55.600 --> 00:11:58.460
It's already in today's news.

00:11:59.190 --> 00:12:01.850
The American media is excellent...

00:12:02.340 --> 00:12:04.850
but this hasn't made it to the public eye yet.

00:12:09.430 --> 00:12:10.540
What is it?

00:12:10.590 --> 00:12:13.470
The Special Police... aka "The Execution Squad."

00:12:14.290 --> 00:12:18.660
By the way, in the back of that picture, you can see a housing facility exclusively for political prisoners.

00:12:19.500 --> 00:12:23.830
Word is they're torturing and executing people in there without a trial.

00:12:24.970 --> 00:12:26.490
That's awful...

00:12:26.720 --> 00:12:29.000
That's supposed to be barred under international law.

00:12:29.450 --> 00:12:31.480
Right. That's why they're hiding it.

00:12:31.600 --> 00:12:33.910
And then America is turning a blind eye.

00:12:34.380 --> 00:12:35.520
Why?

00:12:35.580 --> 00:12:38.690
In exchange for the protection of America's military...

00:12:39.150 --> 00:12:41.750
Raginei provides America with massive financial support.

00:12:45.480 --> 00:12:48.130
The US doesn't want to clumsily antagonize them.

00:12:50.490 --> 00:12:52.000
Your Highness!

00:12:54.470 --> 00:12:57.270
Is it true? What you said?

00:13:00.870 --> 00:13:02.580
Is it true?!

00:13:03.310 --> 00:13:04.900
I'm afraid so.

00:13:04.980 --> 00:13:08.080
That's impossible! My brother would never...

00:13:09.570 --> 00:13:11.940
It's a slum. In Raginei.

00:13:13.860 --> 00:13:17.340
It can't be... we don't have slums in Raginei!

00:13:17.900 --> 00:13:20.040
The arms buildup has put pressure on the national treasury...

00:13:20.670 --> 00:13:24.420
They've brought back taxation, but at a crushing tax rate.

00:13:25.510 --> 00:13:27.630
And the welfare programs were and are shut down.

00:13:27.690 --> 00:13:30.600
No way! There must be leeway in the treasury.

00:13:31.520 --> 00:13:33.520
To empty it in one year!?

00:13:33.640 --> 00:13:35.280
It's not just the armaments!

00:13:35.280 --> 00:13:37.290
There is rampant embezzlement...

00:13:38.040 --> 00:13:39.490
by the chamberlains.

00:13:39.520 --> 00:13:43.600
Don't be ridiculous! The chamberlains of Raginei are members of the clergy!

00:13:44.530 --> 00:13:45.800
To even suggest...

00:13:45.800 --> 00:13:49.620
Hah! You don't know anything, do you? Let me spell it out for you.

00:13:50.830 --> 00:13:53.710
Embezzlement by the chamberlains is nothing new.

00:13:54.660 --> 00:13:58.500
The support of Raginei has been deteriorating from the beginning.

00:14:00.040 --> 00:14:04.200
And now it's infested with termites. That's all there is to it.

00:14:15.280 --> 00:14:16.960
Rumaty!

00:14:21.570 --> 00:14:24.720
It's too much, too fast. The boy's only 16.

00:14:25.440 --> 00:14:29.110
I'm sorry, but if this frightens him, he won't be able to handle what's coming.

00:14:29.750 --> 00:14:33.250
This is just the beginning. If things continue this way, there will be a coup.

00:14:40.480 --> 00:14:41.800
Rumaty!

00:14:46.250 --> 00:14:50.290
I always wanted my brother's trust.

00:14:52.250 --> 00:14:54.670
So I would act the fool...

00:14:55.290 --> 00:14:58.570
I wanted to make him see that I had no interest at all in the crown.

00:14:59.910 --> 00:15:04.640
Even that no longer got his attention, and I was shunned completely, but I still couldn't resent him.

00:15:06.980 --> 00:15:08.420
Rumaty...

00:15:09.480 --> 00:15:11.820
All I felt was sad.

00:15:30.570 --> 00:15:32.300
Are you going to sit?

00:15:33.840 --> 00:15:38.590
It is not permitted for me to speak as an equal with one who receives the oracles of God.

00:15:39.260 --> 00:15:44.980
Hmph! I can see right through you. The gossip about you in the Royal Palace has made it this far.

00:15:45.950 --> 00:15:48.620
You can pretend to be a dog and wag your tail for me, but it won't do any good.

00:15:50.100 --> 00:15:52.270
Impressive as always, Your Highness Najayra.

00:15:53.050 --> 00:15:54.350
What do you want?

00:15:54.650 --> 00:15:57.580
Let's get right to the point, then.

00:15:57.920 --> 00:16:01.770
I want you to stop financially backing Captain Sabaji, immediately.

00:16:04.650 --> 00:16:06.270
I--I'll call the mistress.

00:16:06.430 --> 00:16:08.350
That won't be necessary.

00:16:09.530 --> 00:16:11.530
Where is your proof?

00:16:11.820 --> 00:16:13.160
I have none.

00:16:13.350 --> 00:16:15.770
However, if any were found...

00:16:16.060 --> 00:16:18.990
I'm afraid your right of succession would be forfeit.

00:16:19.560 --> 00:16:21.600
And that would be a problem.

00:16:23.390 --> 00:16:26.880
Because you are needed, Miss Najayra...

00:16:27.170 --> 00:16:31.320
to replace King Somand and take hold of the whole of this country.

00:16:34.670 --> 00:16:36.870
Raisa.

00:16:40.430 --> 00:16:42.470
Bow your head.

00:16:46.700 --> 00:16:48.300
Miss Najayra!

00:16:51.040 --> 00:16:53.060
Your "bait" is contemptibly dull.

00:16:53.500 --> 00:16:57.410
I follow no instructions, and I do as no one says.

00:16:59.400 --> 00:17:04.760
"The whole of it?" How very stupid. I got that long ago.

00:17:04.960 --> 00:17:09.950
I <i>have</i> "the whole of it!" Do not confuse me with Izmal.

00:17:10.550 --> 00:17:14.160
The crown means exactly nothing to me. All I want...

00:17:14.420 --> 00:17:19.110
is someone to relieve this boredom, someone to entertain me!

00:17:20.180 --> 00:17:22.180
That's all.

00:17:29.730 --> 00:17:32.250
Miss Najayra...

00:17:32.990 --> 00:17:34.730
Insolent wretch!

00:17:36.730 --> 00:17:37.900
Quinza!

00:17:41.880 --> 00:17:44.150
Quinza... where are you...

00:17:45.850 --> 00:17:47.190
Quinza!

00:17:51.030 --> 00:17:52.810
Quinza...

00:17:56.560 --> 00:17:58.960
Miss Najayra, perhaps calling for someone would be...

00:17:58.960 --> 00:18:00.360
Bring me my sword.

00:18:00.510 --> 00:18:01.660
Wait, please!

00:18:01.660 --> 00:18:02.850
Quickly!

00:18:11.540 --> 00:18:13.230
Quinza!

00:18:27.280 --> 00:18:29.700
He's just a chamberlain... Answer me!

00:18:30.390 --> 00:18:34.900
Quinza... that insult... what were you playing at?

00:18:36.890 --> 00:18:40.610
Milady's endless boredom...

00:18:41.320 --> 00:18:43.200
I wanted to crack it a little.

00:18:44.140 --> 00:18:45.580
If you grant...

00:18:45.990 --> 00:18:49.630
to your humble servant the honor of death...

00:19:08.560 --> 00:19:13.030
<i>I feel like I've been hearing that distant ocean rumbling my whole life.</i>

00:19:14.500 --> 00:19:19.070
<i>At times, it would whisper in my ear, along with the sound of the rustling palm trees.</i>

00:19:20.100 --> 00:19:23.050
<i>The rumbling sounded like distant thunder...</i>

00:19:32.610 --> 00:19:35.930
I'm too far away, now. I can no longer hear it.

00:19:36.950 --> 00:19:41.460
Now it's just like my mother, whose face I'm not sure I can even remember...

00:19:44.070 --> 00:19:45.770
What's wrong, Kajika?

00:19:45.880 --> 00:19:47.680
It's nothing.

00:19:48.250 --> 00:19:52.700
I'm just a little tired of it. You can call yourself a friend...

00:19:53.130 --> 00:19:57.550
but it's frustrating that you can't do anything to help at a time like this.

00:20:00.730 --> 00:20:03.940
I suppose nothing is permanent...

00:20:04.420 --> 00:20:07.480
The world, people's hearts... they're too frantic.

00:20:09.580 --> 00:20:10.850
Think so?

00:20:11.080 --> 00:20:14.450
That's pretty sentimental, huh. When I get in this mood, I feel so weak, I hate it.

00:20:15.590 --> 00:20:17.710
Humans are weak creatures.

00:20:18.240 --> 00:20:20.500
That's how we came to have higher thoughts.

00:20:21.900 --> 00:20:24.090
Any time now you're going to start preaching.

00:20:25.000 --> 00:20:26.490
Sorry.

00:20:33.120 --> 00:20:38.000
But I can feel safe, knowing Lee-Leng, at least, will never change.

00:20:41.270 --> 00:20:44.500
Whatever happens, he'll always be by my side.

00:20:45.000 --> 00:20:48.540
However far apart we are, he'll be thinking of me.

00:20:49.300 --> 00:20:51.510
And I'll be thinking of him...

00:20:52.910 --> 00:20:54.780
so very dearly.

00:20:54.840 --> 00:20:57.440
This feeling, and only this, is the real thing.

00:21:03.710 --> 00:21:08.550
I thought, at the very least, my brother wasn't the kind of person who would let the country slide into chaos.

00:21:09.870 --> 00:21:14.830
I knew he was tender and timid, unable to express his own opinion without relying on someone else...

00:21:17.070 --> 00:21:20.860
I thought he'd quietly follow the track laid down by our father...

00:21:26.140 --> 00:21:27.470
but--

00:21:27.510 --> 00:21:31.290
I never saw that he was driving my country into ruin!

00:21:32.640 --> 00:21:37.210
Even though the fate of millions rests in his hands!

00:21:39.320 --> 00:21:42.350
To be timid and tender is unpardonable...

00:21:42.940 --> 00:21:45.070
it's already a crime against the state.

00:21:48.890 --> 00:21:52.000
<i>"Things have an ending, so we can start."</i>

00:21:52.930 --> 00:21:55.180
<i>"There is no such thing as eternity."</i>

00:21:55.920 --> 00:21:58.300
<i>"That is why, the end is beautiful."</i>

00:21:59.990 --> 00:22:03.610
<i>"There is still time. You will do it."</i>

00:22:05.700 --> 00:22:07.710
A beautiful end...

00:22:07.880 --> 00:22:10.320
I don't want to see that!

00:22:12.310 --> 00:22:15.300
Don't open it! It looks like a wave.

00:22:26.260 --> 00:22:27.820
You're right...

00:22:28.790 --> 00:22:30.760
Farewell, big brother.

00:22:31.750 --> 00:22:35.220
This is the last time I will shed tears over you.

00:22:36.640 --> 00:22:38.320
From now on...

00:22:41.170 --> 00:22:44.320
that which you've always feared, I will become!

00:23:01.780 --> 00:23:08.380
I can't stand feeling this distance,

00:23:09.150 --> 00:23:16.210
So I'm starting to search for your heart.

00:23:16.700 --> 00:23:22.790
Because you were always at my side, protecting me.

00:23:23.450 --> 00:23:28.020
And I'm afraid of being alone.

00:23:30.240 --> 00:23:37.280
Though it's been a long time, everyone's just the same.

00:23:37.560 --> 00:23:44.720
Whether sleeping now, or crying, I want to see your smiling face.

00:23:44.720 --> 00:23:52.240
Because I will love you, with heart overflowing.

00:23:52.240 --> 00:23:59.330
Don't turn away, look at me. I believe in you.

00:23:59.910 --> 00:24:06.860
So, no one else knows our secret thoughts

00:24:07.250 --> 00:24:14.240
The blue sea of a strong and beautiful time.

00:24:14.590 --> 00:24:24.380
In those arms, in that embrace, I'm alive.
